<title>PERU: Peru's Minsur S.A. 9-mo net up 4.7 pct.</title>
<headline>Peru's Minsur S.A. 9-mo net up 4.7 pct.</headline>
<dateline>LIMA 1996-10-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Share - N.A.</p>
<p>Net - 79.44 million soles vs 75.90 million soles</p>
<p>Revs - 227.24 million soles vs 214.56 million soles</p>
<p>NOTES: Minsur S.A. is the world's third largest tin producer. The company operates the San Rafael mine in Peru's southern highlands.</p>
<p>-- Andrew Cawthorne, Lima newsroom, 511 221-2134</p>
